    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "coach_teacher_language_sp01_01",
      "hash64": "0C2C02551D33A942",
      "text": "Es scheint, dass du auch hier in der Einall-Region\\nsuper klarkommst. So gefällt mir das, eccellente![VAR 0x0114(0026)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 100,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0026"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "coach_teacher_language_sp01_02",
      "hash64": "0C2C01551D33A78F",
      "text": "Die Sprache hier ist die gleiche wie in Paldea,\\naber die Kultur ist etwas anders, oder?\\c\\nHat sich mein Unterricht denn schon als nützlich\\nerwiesen?![VAR 0x0114(0026)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 87,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 150,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0026"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "coach_teacher_language_sp01_select_01",
      "hash64": "CEF387701EB49091",
      "text": "Absolut!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "coach_teacher_language_sp01_select_02",
      "hash64": "CEF384701EB48B78",
      "text": "Nicht besonders...",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "coach_teacher_language_sp01_03",
      "hash64": "0C2C00551D33A5DC",
      "text": "Das macht mich very, very happy zu hören![VAR 0x0114(0026)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 41,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0026"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "coach_teacher_language_sp01_03b",
      "hash64": "E26A4EA09EC2A1DA",
      "text": "Quoi? Das ist bedrückend... Dabei habe ich doch\\nversucht, den Unterricht lehrreich zu gestalten...[VAR 0x0114(0026)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 98,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0026"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "coach_teacher_language_sp01_04",
      "hash64": "0C2BFF551D33A429",
      "text": "Trotzdem bin ich hochmotiviert, die Schülerschaft\\nder Blaubeer-Akademie zu unterrichten![VAR 0x0114(0026)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 88,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0026"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "coach_teacher_language_sp01_05",
      "hash64": "0C2BFE551D33A276",
      "text": "Ich werde mich richtig reinhängen! Gib auch du\\ndein Bestes, [VAR 0x0100(0000)]![VAR 0x0114(0026)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 60,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 65,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0026"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "coach_teacher_language_sp02_00",
      "hash64": "3A95016D2A285162",
      "text": "Merci beaucoup für die erneute Einladung![VAR 0x0114(0026)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 41,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0026"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "coach_teacher_language_sp02_01",
      "hash64": "3A95026D2A285315",
      "text": "Ich bin schon durch viele Regionen gereist.\\nAll die memories von früher machen mich ganz\\r\\nnostalgisch...[VAR 0x0114(0026)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 88,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 106,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0026"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "coach_teacher_language_sp02_select_01",
      "hash64": "D5B856845D611BF4",
      "text": "Welche memories von früher?",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "coach_teacher_language_sp02_select_02",
      "hash64": "D5B859845D61210D",
      "text": "Was haben Sie denn so erlebt?",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "coach_teacher_language_sp02_02",
      "hash64": "3A94FF6D2A284DFC",
      "text": "Ah, bella domanda, [VAR 0x0100(0000)]!\\nGute Frage![VAR 0x0114(0026)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 19,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 36,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0026"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "coach_teacher_language_sp02_03",
      "hash64": "3A95006D2A284FAF",
      "text": "Ich würde mich selber als eine Art Globetrotter\\nbezeichnen.[VAR 0x0114(0026)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 59,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0026"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "coach_teacher_language_sp02_04",
      "hash64": "3A94FD6D2A284A96",
      "text": "Ich habe als Backpacker die Welt bereist, um die\\nschönsten Landschaften der Welt zu bestaunen.[VAR 0x0114(0026)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 94,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0026"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "coach_teacher_language_sp02_05",
      "hash64": "3A94FE6D2A284C49",
      "text": "Écoute, hier kommt eine Quizfrage an dich![VAR 0x0114(0026)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 42,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0026"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "coach_teacher_language_sp02_06",
      "hash64": "3A94FB6D2A284730",
      "text": "La pregunta... Die Frage lautet:\\c\\nWas war wohl der atemberaubendste Anblick,\\nden ich auf meinen Reisen gesehen habe?[VAR 0x0114(0026)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 32,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 118,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0026"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "coach_teacher_language_sp02_select_03",
      "hash64": "D5B858845D611F5A",
      "text": "Ein Gebirge!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "label": "coach_teacher_language_sp02_select_04",
      "hash64": "D5B853845D6116DB",
      "text": "Das Meer!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 22,
      "label": "coach_teacher_language_sp02_select_05",
      "hash64": "D5B852845D611528",
      "text": "Eine Wüste!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 23,
      "label": "coach_teacher_language_sp02_select_06",
      "hash64": "D5B855845D611A41",
      "text": "Eine Stadt!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 24,
      "label": "coach_teacher_language_sp02_07",
      "hash64": "3A94FC6D2A2848E3",
      "text": "No, non, nein! Das stimmt leider nicht. Vielleicht\\nwar die Frage etwas zu difficult.[VAR 0x0114(0026)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 84,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0026"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 25,
      "label": "coach_teacher_language_sp02_08",
      "hash64": "3A95096D2A285EFA",
      "text": "Der allerschönste Anblick war... das Profil einer\\ngewissen Dame![VAR 0x0114(0026)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 64,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0026"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 26,
      "label": "coach_teacher_language_sp02_09",
      "hash64": "3A950A6D2A2860AD",
      "text": "Diese Dame wurde dann meine Frau, mein Schatz,\\nmein amore und chérie.[VAR 0x0114(0026)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 69,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0026"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 27,
      "label": "coach_teacher_language_sp02_10",
      "hash64": "3A98876D2A2B6AEB",
      "text": "Das war eine très, très tolle Geschichte, findest\\ndu nicht? Gern geschehen![VAR 0x0114(0026)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 75,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0026"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 28,
      "label": "coach_teacher_language_sp03_00",
      "hash64": "8FDEB7631B1C0D53",
      "text": "[VAR 0xBD06(0000)][VAR 0x1100(00FF,0506,0000)]LieberLiebe [VAR 0x0100(0000)]! Ich hoffe,\\ndu bist\\r\\ngut\\r\\ndrauf![VAR 0x0114(0026)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 0,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "BD06",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 4,
          "count": 4,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0506",
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
