    },
    {
      "ordinal": 29,
      "label": "coach_teacher_language_sp03_01",
      "hash64": "8FDEB6631B1C0BA0",
      "text": "Die Schüler an dieser Akademie sind wirklich\\nvoller Lerneifer. Me gusta, sehr gut![VAR 0x0114(0026)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 82,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0026"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 30,
      "label": "coach_teacher_language_sp03_02",
      "hash64": "8FDEB9631B1C10B9",
      "text": "Sie streben danach, als Trainer auch international\\nerfolgreich zu sein, und wollen sich deshalb neue\\r\\nSprachen aneignen.[VAR 0x0114(0026)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 100,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 122,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0026"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 31,
      "label": "coach_teacher_language_sp03_03",
      "hash64": "8FDEB8631B1C0F06",
      "text": "Man setzt sich klare Ziele und... voilà!\\nSchon steigt die Motivation.[VAR 0x0114(0026)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 69,
          "count": 2,
